cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Land.Tree Survey in your research, please cite this software."
title: "Land.Tree Survey: An Offline Mobile Application for Georeferenced Tree Inventory and Dendrometric Data Collection"
type: software
version: 1.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-09
authors:
  - family-names: Niang
    given-names: Al Housseynou
    affiliation: "Centre de Suivi Écologique (CSE); Université numérique Cheikh Hamidou Kane (UN-CHK)"
abstract: >-
  Land.Tree Survey is an offline-first Flutter mobile application for plot-based,
  georeferenced tree inventories. It supports simple surveys, dendrometric
  measurements, GPS coordinates, photographs, local storage, cloud
  synchronization and structured CSV/XLSX exports.
keywords:
  - tree inventory
  - agroforestry
  - dendrometry
  - GPS
  - mobile data collection
  - Flutter
repository-code: "https://github.com/alouzz123/cse_field_dendro_2026"
